  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>We know that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>Only&#160;A</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>Only&#160;B</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/390d7f37-86e4-4e8e-b475-83e1c0acb89a-image.png\" style=\"width: 243px; height: 169px;\" /></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
